#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:6
msgid "$inmulti"
msgstr "$inmulti"

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:8
#, fuzzy
msgid "Usage: **$inmulti(multi,value[,separator])**"
msgstr "Utilisation : **$inmulti(%x%,y)**"

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:9
msgid "Category: conditional"
msgstr "Catégorie : conditionnel"

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 1.0"
msgstr "Mis en œuvre : Picard 1.0"

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**Description :**"

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:14
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Returns true if the multi-value variable ``multi`` contains exactly "
"``value`` as one of its values. Note that comparisons are case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"Renvoie true si la variable à valeurs multiples ``x`` contient exactement "
"``y`` comme l'une de ses valeurs. Notez que les comparaisons sont sensibles "
"à la casse."

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:16
msgid ""
"A literal value representing a multi-value can be substituted for ``multi``, "
"using the ``separator`` (or a semicolon followed by a space \"; \" if not "
"passed) to coerce the value into a proper multi-valued variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_inmulti.rst:22
msgid ""
"Formatting the code using characters such as spaces, tabs or newlines can "
"affect the result of the function."
msgstr ""
"Le formatage du code à l'aide de caractères tels que des espaces, des "
"tabulations ou des sauts de ligne peut affecter le résultat de la fonction."

